// Title: Suspicious Space Characters in TypedPaths Registry Path - FileFix
// Sigma ID: 8f2a5c3d-9e4b-4a7c-8d1f-2e5a6b9c3d7e
// Status: experimental | Level: high
// Author: Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2025-11-04 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, stealth, T1204.004, T1027.010
// Description: Detects the occurrence of numerous space characters in TypedPaths registry paths, which may
//   indicate execution via phishing lures using file-fix techniques to hide malicious commands.
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://expel.com/blog/cache-smuggling-when-a-picture-isnt-a-thousand-words/
//   - https://mrd0x.com/filefix-clickfix-alternative/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ebd26c2d9cd57dc9489faa1f1346577be9947747/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_susp_typedpaths_space_characters.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceRegistryEvents
| where (RegistryKey endswith "\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Explorer\\TypedPaths\\url1" and RegistryValueData contains "#") and (RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            ")
